  <button class="menu-toggle" id="menuToggle" aria-label="Toggle navigation" aria-expanded="false">☰</button>
</header>

<main>
<section class="section hero" id="home">
  <div>
    <div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> AN EXPERIMENT IN OPEN TECHNOLOGY</div>
    <h1>Reboot the<br><span class="gradient">ordinary.</span></h1>
    <p class="description">Meet RokrOS — a project exploring what's possible when curiosity, creativity, and hardware come together.</p>
    <div class="buttons">
      <a class="btn primary" href="#about">Discover RokrOS <span>→</span></a>
      <a class="btn secondary" href="#roadmap">View the roadmap</a>
    </div>
    <div class="note"><strong>$_</strong><span>Built by experimenting. Driven by curiosity.</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="visual">
    <div class="visual-label"><span class="dot"></span> SYSTEM CONCEPT</div>
    <div class="window">
      <div class="window-top">
        <div class="window-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
        <span>rokr-terminal — 80 × 24</span><span>···</span>
      </div>
      <div class="terminal">
        <p class="terminal-muted">RokrOS interactive shell</p>
        <p><span class="green">user@rokros</span>:<span class="blue">~</span>$ neofetch</p>
        <div class="system">
<pre class="ascii">  ____       _     ____   ____
 |  _ \ ___ | | __|  _ \ / ___|
 | |_) / _ \| |/ /| |_) | |
 |  _ < (_) |   < |  _ <| |___
 |_| \_\___/|_|\_\|_| \_\\____|</pre>
          <div class="info">
            <p><b>OS</b>: RokrOS</p>
            <p><b>Type</b>: Experimental</p>
            <p><b>Philosophy</b>: Open</p>
            <p><b>Mission</b>: Explore</p>
            <p><b>Creator</b>: DaryTech</p>
            <p class="green">● Ready for discovery</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p><span class="green">user@rokros</span>:<span class="blue">~</span>$ <span class="cursor"></span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="window-bottom"><span>UTF-8</span><span>LOCAL SESSION</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="chip chip-top"><b>✳</b> Built to experiment</div>
    <div class="chip chip-bottom"><span class="dot"></span> Curiosity: ACTIVE</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="stats">
  <div class="stat"><span class="symbol">⌘</span><span><b>Open-minded</b><small>Built around learning</small></span></div>
  <div class="stat"><span class="symbol">⌁</span><span><b>Experimental</b><small>Try something different</small></span></div>
  <div class="stat"><span class="symbol">⌬</span><span><b>Hardware curious</b><small>From boards to computers</small></span></div>
  <div class="stat"><span class="symbol">↗</span><span><b>Always evolving</b><small>A project in progress</small></span></div>
</section>

<section class="section content" id="features">
  <div class="heading">
    <span class="kicker">THE PHILOSOPHY</span>
    <h2>Less limitation.<br><span class="gradient">More exploration.</span></h2>
    <p>Technology should be something you can understand, experiment with, and make your own.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cards">
    <article class="card">
      <div class="icon purple">⌘</div><h3>Built to explore</h3>
      <p>A place for testing ideas, learning how systems work, and finding new ways to use technology.</p>
      <span class="card-number">01 / EXPLORE</span>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <div class="icon green-bg">⌁</div><h3>Hardware first</h3>
      <p>Inspired by hands-on experimentation, embedded projects, and getting more out of existing hardware.</p>
      <span class="card-number">02 / BUILD</span>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <div class="icon orange">⌬</div><h3>Learn by doing</h3>
      <p>Every experiment is a chance to understand more about software, systems, and engineering.</p>
      <span class="card-number">03 / LEARN</span>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about-section" id="about">
  <div class="about-inner">
    <div class="orbit-art">
      <div class="orbit"></div><div class="orbit two"></div>
      <div class="core"><span>R</span></div>
      <span class="tag one">OPEN</span><span class="tag two">CREATE</span><span class="tag three">REPEAT</span>
    </div>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <span class="kicker">WHAT IS ROKROS?</span>
      <h2>A project with<br>a <span class="gradient">different mindset.</span></h2>
      <p>RokrOS is an independent technology project by DaryTech. It's a space to experiment with operating-system ideas, explore hardware, and turn curiosity into working projects.</p>
      <p>This website is the project's home on the web. As development progresses, updates, experiments, and future releases can appear here.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="https://darycodey.github.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit DaryTech <span>↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section content roadmap-section" id="roadmap">
  <div class="heading">
    <span class="kicker">THE ROAD AHEAD</span>
    <h2>One experiment<br>at a time.</h2>
    <p>Planning stages for the project, not claims of completed features.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="roadmap">
    <article class="road-item"><span class="road-number">01</span><div><span class="road-status">FOUNDATION</span><h3>Define the vision</h3><p>Document the goals, target hardware, and core ideas behind RokrOS.</p></div></article>
    <article class="road-item"><span class="road-number">02</span><div><span class="road-status">EXPERIMENTS</span><h3>Build and test</h3><p>Prototype features, test hardware, and record what works.</p></div></article>
    <article class="road-item"><span class="road-number">03</span><div><span class="road-status">DOCUMENTATION</span><h3>Share the progress</h3><p>Publish build notes, project updates, and instructions as they become available.</p></div></article>
    <article class="road-item"><span class="road-number">04</span><div><span class="road-status">FUTURE</span><h3>Release when ready</h3><p>Provide downloads and release notes if and when a usable build is available.</p></div></article>
  </div>
</section>

