  <div class="download-glow"></div>
  <div class="download-inner">
    <span class="kicker">YOUR NEXT EXPERIMENT</span>
    <h2>Curiosity starts<br><span class="gradient">somewhere.</span></h2>
    <p>RokrOS is a work in progress. Follow the project for updates as development moves forward.</p>
    <div class="buttons centered">
      <a class="btn primary" href="https://darycodey.github.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore DaryTech ↗</a>
      <a class="btn secondary" href="#home">Back to the top ↑</a>
